direction: right
Read: "READ\nPrimary Sources"
Define: "DEFINE\nAgree on Terms"
Argue: "ARGUE\nProposition + Syllogism"
Debate: "DEBATE\nSteelman + Switch Sides"
Experiment: "EXPERIMENT\nPredict + Measure"
Evaluate: "EVALUATE\nFallacies + Evidence"
Write: "WRITE\nClaim + Evidence + Reasoning"
Mastery: "MASTERY\nRetain + Transfer"
Read -> Define -> Argue -> Debate -> Experiment -> Evaluate -> Write -> Mastery
Mastery -> Read: "spaced review"
